; gcode/test_grid.ngc
; LASER TEST GRID - this job WILL fire the laser. Wear glasses.
; powers (S)   left  -> right : 400, 600, 800, 1000
; speeds mm/min bottom-> top  : 800, 1600, 2400, 3200
; grid origin  X20.0 Y20.0   size 32.0x32.0 mm
; line spacing 0.120 mm   cell 5.0 mm
G90 ;absolute
G21 ;mm
M5
G0 X20.000 Y20.000 F7000
; orientation marker (bottom-left corner bracket)
M3 S1000
